  "historyNote": "#8101, eff 1-1-05; ss by #8942, eff 9-15-07, EXPIRED: 9-15-15 New. #11075, INTERIM, eff 4-18-16, EXPIRED: 10-15-16 New. #12010, eff 10-21-16 (from Gal 302.04)",
